    <bpmn:process id="W_W4970" name="W4970. Bulky-Goods Loading into Customer Vehicles (Lumber, Tile, Cement, Appliance)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Counter release (W4962); appointment (W4963); customer at loading bay
Frequency: Continuous × 200 stores
Volume: ~7–10 bulky loads per store per day × 200 stores (per W950)
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Loaders
Participants: Loaders, Forklift Operators (W4969), Spotters (W4971), Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4970 — Bulky-Goods Loading into Customer Vehicles (Lumber, Tile, Cement, Appliance)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4970_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4970_Lane1" name="Loader">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4970_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4970_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4970_Lane2" name="Loaders">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4970_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4970_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4970_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4970_Start4" name="Counter release (W4962); appointment (W4963); customer at loading bay">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4970_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4970_Task5" name="Prepare the load &amp; vehicle: confirm the order/items (from W4962), position the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Prepare the load &amp; vehicle: confirm the order/items (from W4962), position the customer vehicle in the bay, verify vehicle suitability (W4968), and plan the load (order, weight distribution W4972, securement points)
Responsible (R): Loader / Supervisor / Customer
Accountable (A): Loading-Zone Supervisor
Duration: Per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4970_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4970_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4970_Task6" name="Load the bulky goods: load lumber (length/cantilever), tile (pallet/crate)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Load the bulky goods: load lumber (length/cantilever), tile (pallet/crate), cement (bags/pallet), appliances (W4976 fragile/hazardous), using the forklift (W4969) or manual handling (W4975), with the spotter (W4971) guiding; protect the vehicle and goods from damage
Responsible (R): Loaders / Operator / Spotter
Accountable (A): Loading-Zone Supervisor
Duration: Per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4970_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4970_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4970_Task7" name="Secure &amp; hand off: secure the load (W4972), confirm completeness/condition with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Secure &amp; hand off: secure the load (W4972), confirm completeness/condition with the customer, capture the load/release confirmation, advise the customer on safe transport, and clear the bay for the next pickup
Responsible (R): Loaders / Supervisor / Customer
Accountable (A): Loading-Zone Supervisor
Duration: Per load</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4970_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4970_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4970_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4970_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4970_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-744 (ensure controlled execution — Bulky-Goods Loading, Forklift-in-Customer-Area &amp; Vehicle Coordination (PA-171.2).) | - CTL-744: order verified; vehicle suitability checked; load secured (W4972); completeness/condition confirmed with customer
Owner: Loading-Zone Supervisor / Loaders</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4970_Assoc10" sourceRef="W4970_Annotation9" targetRef="W4970_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4970_Flow11" sourceRef="W4970_Start4" targetRef="W4970_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4970_Flow12" sourceRef="W4970_Task5" targetRef="W4970_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4970_Flow13" sourceRef="W4970_Task6" targetRef="W4970_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4970_Flow14" sourceRef="W4970_Task7" targetRef="W4970_End8" />
    </bpmn:process>
