    <bpmn:process id="W_W4973" name="W4973. Forklift Operator Qualification, Equipment Inspection &amp; DOLE OSH Compliance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Operator onboarding; equipment use (W4969); periodic compliance; incident
Frequency: Per operator + daily pre-use + periodic audit
Volume: ~2–3 trained operators per store × 200 stores; ~1–2 units of loading equipment per store
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Yard Lead / Store Ops
Participants: HSE (VS-24), Forklift Operators, Training (VS-19.4/VS-169 PPE), Store Ops (VS-07), Occupational Health (VS-83)
Source: workflow W4973 — Forklift Operator Qualification, Equipment Inspection &amp; DOLE OSH Compliance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4973_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4973_Lane1" name="HSE">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4973_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4973_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4973_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4973_Lane2" name="Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4973_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4973_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4973_Start4" name="Operator onboarding; equipment use (W4969); periodic compliance; incident">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4973_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4973_Task5" name="Qualify operators per DOLE OSH (forklift/reach-truck): training…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Qualify operators per DOLE OSH (forklift/reach-truck): training, certification/licensing, competency assessment, medical/fitness (links VS-83), PPE issuance (VS-169), and the operator register; only qualified operators use equipment in the customer area (W4969)
Responsible (R): HSE / Training / Occupational Health
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Per operator</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4973_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4973_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4973_Task6" name="Inspect equipment pre-use: daily pre-use inspection (forks, brakes, hydraulics…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inspect equipment pre-use: daily pre-use inspection (forks, brakes, hydraulics, tires, lights/horn, seatbelt), defect tag-out, and maintenance/refuel/charge per the schedule (links VS-138/VS-35); no defective equipment in service
Responsible (R): Operator / Yard Lead / Facilities
Accountable (A): HSE Lead / Supervisor
Duration: Daily</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4973_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4973_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4973_Task7" name="Audit &amp; comply: periodic DOLE-OSH forklift compliance audit, operator…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit &amp; comply: periodic DOLE-OSH forklift compliance audit, operator re-certification, equipment maintenance records, incident investigation (VS-24), and feed the customer-safety program (VS-147)
Responsible (R): HSE / Internal Audit (VS-21) / Facilities
Accountable (A): HSE Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4973_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4973_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4973_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4973_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4973_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-97 (ensure will-call release integrity &amp; loading safety.) | - CTL-744: qualified/certified operators only; pre-use inspection logged; defective equipment tagged out; DOLE-OSH audited
Owner: HSE (VS-24) / Yard Lead / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
