    <bpmn:process id="W_W4974" name="W4974. Carry-Out, Curbside &amp; Drive-Up Assistance Service" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer needs assistance carrying goods; curbside/drive-up request
Frequency: Continuous × 200 stores
Volume: ~10–30 carry-out/curbside events per store per day × 200 stores
Owner: Will-Call/Loading-Zone Supervisor / Store Ops
Participants: Loaders/Carry-Out Staff, Store Ops (VS-07), CX (VS-13), Customer Safety (VS-147)
Source: workflow W4974 — Carry-Out, Curbside &amp; Drive-Up Assistance Service</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4974_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4974_Lane1" name="Carry-Out Staff">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4974_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4974_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4974_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4974_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4974_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4974_Start3" name="Customer needs assistance carrying goods; curbside/drive-up request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4974_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4974_Task4" name="Provide carry-out assistance: for customers needing help (elderly, PWD…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Provide carry-out assistance: for customers needing help (elderly, PWD, bulky/heavy items), staff carry/assist goods to the vehicle, with carts/dollies and safe manual handling (links VS-24 manual handling, VS-147)
Responsible (R): Carry-Out Staff / Loaders
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4974_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4974_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4974_Task5" name="Operate curbside/drive-up pickup: customer parks in a designated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Operate curbside/drive-up pickup: customer parks in a designated curbside/drive-up spot, staff bring the staged order (W4965) to the vehicle, verify (W4962), and load (W4970); manage the curbside queue
Responsible (R): Carry-Out Staff / Counter Staff
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4974_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4974_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4974_Task6" name="Manage accessibility &amp; safety: PWD/elderly/special-assistance priority (RA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage accessibility &amp; safety: PWD/elderly/special-assistance priority (RA 7277/BP 344), safe manual handling to prevent injury (staff and customer), and incident reporting (VS-24/VS-147)
Responsible (R): Carry-Out Staff / HSE / CX
Accountable (A): Supervisor
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4974_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4974_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4974_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4974_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4974_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-744 (ensure controlled execution — Bulky-Goods Loading, Forklift-in-Customer-Area &amp; Vehicle Coordination (PA-171.2).) | - CTL-744: assistance provided on request; PWD priority; safe manual handling; curbside designated/controlled
Owner: Will-Call/Loading-Zone Supervisor / Store Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
